Het S-gc-gpu-relaxed
"Heterogeneous S-gc-gpu-relaxed: per-proc device assignment gpu,cpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA/PTX)"
{
1:X1=x;
1:X3=y;
}
 P0:gpu             | P1:cpu      ;
 w[relaxed,gpu] x 2 | LDR W0,[X3] ;
 w[relaxed,gpu] y 1 | MOV W2,#1   ;
                    | STR W2,[X1] ;
exists (1:X0=1 /\ [x]=2)
